\section{Results}
The laboratory palette is used below and exact values are reported.
\begin{figure}[ht]
\centering
\begin{tikzpicture}
\begin{axis}[
    width=0.8\linewidth,
    height=0.45\linewidth,
    xlabel={System},
    ylabel={Score},
    xtick={0,1},
    xticklabels={Base, New},
    ymin=0, ymax=1,
    ymajorgrids=true,
    legend pos=south east,
    legend style={font=\small},
    every axis plot/.append style={line width=1.4pt},
]
\addplot[color=blue!70!black, mark=*, nodes near coords] coordinates {(0,0.81) (1,0.86)};
\addlegendentry{Accuracy}
\addplot[color=red!70!black, mark=square*, nodes near coords] coordinates {(0,0.74) (1,0.79)};
\addlegendentry{Recall}
\end{axis}
\end{tikzpicture}
\caption{Performance trend from Base to New}
\label{fig:performance}
\end{figure}
The exact values are Base: 0.81 and 0.74; New: 0.86 and 0.79.
